legends of long forgotten artifacts and claim the fabled power to obliterate your enemies!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839660/extras/bfd94d698a1adb8eefca9a5136eccd2c.avif?t=1728852879\" /></div>The Crystal Legion\u2019s main gameplay mechanics and combos feature a variety of <strong>supporting and stabilizing abilities</strong>, while you take control of the battlefield with <strong>mighty golems and ancient spells.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Is the game Pay-to-win?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is explicitly not pay-to-win. You can unlock any cards in the game with in-game currencies. Our business model is free-to-play and pay-to-advance-faster, the ONLY things that can only be bought with real money are skins, to help support the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are there any secrets with exclusive stuff?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sure, you just found one of eight secrets to redeem in the ingame shop: <strong>XR0F-7ST3-4MC0-MMUN-1TYX</strong> \ud83c\udf8a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839660/extras/5f974f93bdeb392cee1ece10eaac332c.avif?t=1728852879\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Our Next Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Galactic Glitch - A physics-based Action-Roguelike</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839660/extras/286415bcc4899bbb0ab1973279871769.poster.avif?t=1728852879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839660/extras/286415bcc4899bbb0ab1973279871769.webm?t=1728852879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839660/extras/286415bcc4899bbb0ab1973279871769.mp4?t=1728852879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
